      "id": "qa_0ed1c87426654207bedc2a29f05d0dc3",
      "question": "Mujhe urologist ko dikhana hai kya waiting hai?",
      "answer": "To consult a urologist at King George's Medical University (KGMU), online registration through the Online Registration System (ORS) at [ors.gov.in](https://ors.gov.in) is mandatory. \n\nUrology OPD consultations are held on the Fourth Floor (Rooms 420 and 421) from Monday to Saturday. \n\nPlease note that exact real-time waiting hours can vary depending on patient volume on the day of your visit. Pre-booking your appointment online or arriving early is strongly recommended, as the registration counter/ticket slip counter closes at 1:00 PM sharp. Outside-city patients should also bring a valid referral for the specific department. \n\nFor further assistance, you can contact the PRO Office at 9415007710 or call the KGMU helpline at 0522-2258880 / 0522-3539333.",
