    {
      "id": "qa_c5755e08616246698de8f647d7595754",
      "question": "how ca i apply fo pateint chechup",
      "answer": "To book an OPD patient check-up at KGMU, online registration is mandatory. You can use any of the following methods to book an appointment (the OPD slip fee is ₹50):\n\n1. **Online (ORS Portal):** Visit [ors.gov.in](https://ors.gov.in), select Uttar Pradesh, choose KGMU, select the department and date, fill in your details, pay the ₹50 fee, and download your slip.\n2. **Mobile App:** Register on the ABHA / Health Care App using your mobile number and OTP, then follow the same hospital selection process.\n3. **SMS:** Send an SMS in the format `APPOINTMENT <Patient Name>` to **8887019134**.\n4. **Walk-in:** Visit the hospital with your Aadhaar card and active mobile number to complete OTP verification, collect a physical token, pay ₹50, and get your OPD slip. \n\n*Note:* Pre-booking is strongly recommended to avoid long wait times. The ticket counter closes at 1:00 PM sharp. Outside-city patients must bring a valid referral for the specific department.",
